+### Assign a ticket: `PUT /tickets/:id/assignee`
+
+```json
+{ "assignee": "sam" }
+```
+
+Assigns the ticket to the agent, a name of 1 to 64 characters on one line; `{ "assignee": null }` unassigns it. Answers
+200 with the ticket. Only open and in-progress tickets can be assigned or unassigned (409 `conflict` otherwise). Assigning
+a ticket to the agent it already has changes nothing: no audit entry, no notification. A new assignment is audited as
+`ticket.assigned` and the agent is notified; an unassignment notifies nobody.
